WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.560
- I feel free when I fly the balloon.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:04.630
The feelings.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.210
The goosebumps that you get.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.455
It's amazing.

00:00:07.455 --> 00:00:10.830
(soft upbeat music)

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.270
Living in Dubai gave me the opportunity

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.770
to do something that I love.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.530
You don't realize the
real beauty of the desert

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.003
until you see it from above.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.180
- My name is Mark Beaumont,

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.630
and I'm an endurance athlete.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.580
With the current world record
for cycling around the planet,

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.330
seeking adventures and finding stories

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.560
is what I'm most passionate about.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.020
Ever since I can remember,

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:43.052
I've had that sense of
curiosity about the world.

00:00:43.052 --> 00:00:44.940
(water bubbling)

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.643
This time, I've come to Dubai.

00:00:47.611 --> 00:00:50.444
(uplifting music)

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:57.320
When I travel to anywhere new,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.970
it doesn't matter where
I am on planet Earth,

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:00.410
I try and get to the high point.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.820
Whether it's the highest
building or the mountain,

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.833
to get a perspective on
where I am; I love that.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:09.930
I met with Edgora, a mum
of two and in training

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:13.230
to become UAE's first
female hot air balloon pilot

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:15.950
to explore many of the heights of Dubai.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.150
- My name Edgora. I'm from Uzbekistan,

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:20.983
and for the last 16 years
I live here in Dubai.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:25.570
I'm a hot air balloon
pilot in training, a wife,

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:27.433
but most importantly, I'm a mother.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.820
My daughter, she's five
now; my son, he's three;

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:36.230
and Dubai is one of the best
cities to have children.

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:37.500
There is so much to do;

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.363
you can entertain them
everyday, different stuff.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:46.540
After trying my first flight
with Balloon Adventures,

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:50.350
being in the basket, the
balloon floating through the air

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:53.650
and absorbing the whole
beauty of the flight

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:57.290
made me think, OK, this
is what I want to do,

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.013
and my interests quickly
became my passion.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:06.990
To be first female hot air
balloon pilot in the UAE

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:11.630
makes me feel very grateful,
and I hope I can encourage

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:14.540
other women to follow their dreams,

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.260
because that would make feel very honored.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.030
The feeling never changes each
and every time you take off;

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:22.530
you always feel like, "Wow."

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.360
I always feel the
goosebumps; it's always nice.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:26.650
You'd never get used to that;

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:28.550
it's just magical, each and every time.

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.260
- When you're driving through the desert

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.690
it kind of looks quite samey,

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:36.220
but when you fly above it, it's incredible

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:39.070
how much change there is,
especially at that first light.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.600
When they turn the engines
off, you hear nothing.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.760
That's beautiful, and
you've just got the view

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:50.240
and that space and that
incredible horizon.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.110
I've got to see so much
of Dubai during this trip,

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.660
but that's a different perspective.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:58.940
To fly over the desert is a
pretty extraordinary view.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.403
It's unlike anything
I've done; it's unique.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:03.911
- [Man] One, two, three--

00:03:03.911 --> 00:03:05.828
- [Group] Good morning!

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.800
- Being adventurous, it is about the want

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:13.670
to not just observe the world
but the want to experience it.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.700
To make your own mind up,
to think for yourself.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.340
It's intrigue; it's interest.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.510
It's wanting to do things and explore

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.810
and to ask the questions.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.950
- To be a hot air balloon pilot

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:28.390
makes me feel very proud, very grateful.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:32.720
From the first time that I
was in a balloon and now,

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.858
I feel that I have accomplished a lot,

00:03:34.858 --> 00:03:38.780
and I'm looking forward to
getting more and more experience

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.375
and to share my passion with others.

00:03:42.375 --> 00:03:45.458
(motivational music)

